 "remarks": "Located in the heart of downtown Stamford, this bright and airy one-bedroom, one-bathroom condo delivers contemporary living at its finest. The spacious open-concept layout seamless connects a sunlit living and dining area to a beautiful eat-in kitchen featuring a granite breakfast bar and premium stainless steel appliances. Rich hardwood floors, recessed lighting, and crown molding run throughout, leading out through glass sliders to your own private terrace with sweeping city views. Convenience is built-in with an in-unit ventless washer/dryer, gated designated parking, ample guest spaces, and dedicated bike storage. Commuters will love the short walk to the Metro-North station for an effortless trip into NYC, while weekends invite you to step right outside your door to explore Stamford's vibrant dining, nightlife, and shopping scene. Exceptional style and ideal proximity combine to make this property a rare find.",
